# Format Comparison

Capability-by-capability comparison of the `.hd` format against Markdown, raw HTML, and Nextra docs (MDX-based). The Nextra column is intentionally left blank for now and will be filled in as the comparison work progresses.

## Icon legend

-   ✅ — supported natively
    
-   ⚠️ — partial, lossy, or escape-hatch (raw HTML inside Markdown, tool-dependent, etc.)
    
-   ⛔ — not supported
    
-   — — not applicable to that format
    

