</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Paste from Markdown</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes (auto-detect &amp; convert)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>— N/A</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Editor-dependent</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Paste from HTML</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes (sanitized against allow-list)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Tool-dependent</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>— N/A</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Copy as Markdown</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>— N/A</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Tool-dependent</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Rendering and interop</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Renders in a browser as a single file</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Wrapped by a server / editor</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Needs a renderer</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Renders natively in GitHub web UI</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⛔ No (shows source)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⛔ No (shows source)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Paste into Notion / Slack / Linear</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>⚠️ Via Copy as Markdown / HTML</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>✅ Yes (varies)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Identity and assets</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Stable doc ID independent of filename</p></td>