## Reading the matrix

-   **✅ "Yes"** means the format expresses the capability natively, without escape hatches.
    
-   **⚠️ "Raw HTML only"** means the capability is reachable in Markdown only by embedding literal HTML inside the document.
    
-   **⚠️ "Editor-dependent"** / **"Tool-dependent"** means the format itself doesn't define behavior; whether it works hinges on which editor or pipeline you use.
    
-   **⛔ "No"** means the format has no way to express the capability at all.
    
-   The Nextra column is intentionally blank pending a focused capability sweep of the Nextra / MDX feature surface.
